# Engineering Power

Engineering Power skills are installed for Cursor under `.cursor/skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md`.

When a request matches an Engineering Power workflow, prefer the corresponding skill from the local `skills/` suite and keep analysis grounded in repository evidence. Do not bypass the shared evidence engine for repository, pull-request, comparison, working-tree, or patch analysis.

The canonical source in this repository is the flat `skills/` directory. Generated or host-specific skill packages must not be committed back into this repository.